Saturation -- ideal and submodule quotient, saturation, and annihilator routines
********************************************************************************

Description
===========

This package provides various basic commutative algebra routines for working
with ideals and modules.

Main functionalities

  * *note ideal quotients and saturation: ideal quotients and saturation,
  * *note module quotients, saturation, and annihilator: module quotients_cm
    saturation_cm and annihilator,
* Menu:

* quotient(Ideal,Ideal): (Macaulay2Doc)quotient_lpIdeal_cmIdeal_rp.
* annihilator::                 the annihilator ideal
* saturate::                    saturation of ideal or submodule

